    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606607
    m_Localized: You already have {0} {1}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606608
    m_Localized: You can only upgrade between streams.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606609
    m_Localized: Your Sub Cap is maxed out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606610
    m_Localized: Nobody is waiting to join.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606611
    m_Localized: You've hit your Sub Cap. You'll have to deny them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606612
    m_Localized: There's nothing to decide.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606613
    m_Localized: Pick one of the revealed viewers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606614
    m_Localized: That viewer can't be replaced.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606615
    m_Localized: There's nobody to ban.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606616
    m_Localized: That viewer wasn't in the swatted stream.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606617
    m_Localized: Finish tonight's stream first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606618
    m_Localized: That was the final stream.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606619
    m_Localized: You're streaming without a streamer power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606620
    m_Localized: 'This power is passive: it''s always on.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606621
    m_Localized: Streamer powers are used in the shop, after your stream.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606622
    m_Localized: This power needs a rival to hit (multiplayer only).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606623
    m_Localized: 'Recharging: ready in {0} {0:plural:turn|turns}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606624
    m_Localized: Already armed for your next stream.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606625
    m_Localized: There's no next stream to use it on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606626
    m_Localized: There's no viewer in the shop to catch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606627
    m_Localized: Pick a rival who's still in the season.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606628
    m_Localized: That rival has no {icon:cash} to tax.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606629
    m_Localized: Automatic (your streamer's setup)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606630
    m_Localized: Evolving (grows with your Sub Cap)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606631
    m_Localized: The goal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606632
    m_Localized: 'Pull off one stream with <b>4 Trophy viewers in chat at the same
      time</b>, and end it successfully before your final night (25 by default).
      Recruiting four Trophies isn''t enough: they have to show up together.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606633
    m_Localized: A round has two halves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606634
    m_Localized: <b>1. The stream.</b> Press <b>Add Viewer to Chat</b> to let the
      next viewer from your Audience join. Each viewer can join once per stream.
      Viewers with a purple <b>action</b> button can use it once per stream. When
      you're happy, press <b>End the Stream</b> to bank what everyone in chat brought
      in.\n<b>2. The shop.</b> Viewers bring in {icon:subs}; when the stream ends
      they're banked and recruit new viewers into your Audience. {icon:cash} raises
      your <b>Sub Cap</b> (how many viewers fit in chat at once).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606635
    m_Localized: '{icon:risk} Deplatform Risk'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606636
    m_Localized: 'Viewers with a red X add {icon:risk}. Up to 2 net {icon:risk} is
      fine; at <b>3 the stream gets deplatformed</b>: it ends with no payout and
      you give one viewer a <b>Temporary Ban</b> (they sit out the next stream).
      Normie, Die Hard Fan and Internet Starpower <b>cancel</b> 1 {icon:risk} each
      while in chat, and {icon:Mods} Mods may cancel 1 more at the start of your
      next stream. Some viewers add {icon:risk} with their actions; the Chat Arbitrator
      clears risk.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606637
    m_Localized: Sub Cap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606638
    m_Localized: You can't add viewers once you've hit your Sub Cap, but viewers
      who <b>bring</b> others (Marketing Manager, Online Scandal, Bigger Star) can
      push you over it. If that happens the <b>server goes down</b> and the stream
      ends with no payout. Leave spare room!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606639
    m_Localized: Money
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606640
    m_Localized: 'Raising your Sub Cap costs 2 {icon:cash}, then 1 more each time
      (max 12 per space, up to 34). Some viewers charge fees (negative {icon:cash}).
      Fees are paid from your {icon:cash}; any unpaid amount costs <b>7 {icon:subs}
      per {icon:cash}</b>.\nThe shop''s stock is <b>shared by every player</b>: each
      normal viewer has 4 copies for the whole match, and you can own at most 4 of
      each; Trophies are unlimited. You can''t remove viewers from your Audience,
      so every recruit changes your odds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606641
    m_Localized: Actions and families
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606642
    m_Localized: Every action has a type (Recruit, Remove, Modify, Shuffle, Scout,
      Economy). Some actions ask you to pick one or two viewers; actions that take
      several viewers show a Confirm button. Permanent changes (the Affiliate's Checkout
      Code, Gen Z with Job) stay with that viewer card forever. Hover any viewer
      to see its communities, action type and tonight's effects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606643
    m_Localized: Streamers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606644
    m_Localized: 'Before a season you <b>Select Your Streamer</b>. Each one has a
      power: <b>passive</b> powers are always on; <b>active</b> powers are used from
      the shop after your stream (on your turn), cost {icon:cash}, get more expensive
      every time you use them (like raising your Sub Cap) and may need a few turns
      to recharge. <b>Rival</b> powers (Raid, Wealth Tax) hit another player, so
      they only work in multiplayer. Pick <b>No Streamer</b> to play the classic
      rules. Your streamer also brings their own stream setup.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606645
    m_Localized: Controls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606646
    m_Localized: <b>Space</b> add viewer / confirm picks / next stream   <b>E</b>
      end the stream   <b>R</b> Audience   <b>Esc</b> cancel / menu   <b>F11</b>
      fullscreen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606647
    m_Localized: Multiplayer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606648
    m_Localized: 'Everyone gets the same character set and starts with the same Audience,
      and everyone can watch every stream: click a player in the Players panel to
      see their board live. In <b>Take Turns</b> mode (the default) players stream
      one after another each night while everyone else watches what they point at,
      pick and buy, and the season ends after the first night someone pulls off a
      stream with 4 Trophies. The host can set a turn timer. In <b>Synchronized Nights</b>
      mode everyone plays the same night at once and the next night starts when every
      player is ready. In <b>Race</b> mode everyone plays at their own pace and the
      first stream with 4 Trophies wins instantly. If nobody wins, the best Trophy
      count in a successful stream takes it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606649
    m_Localized: <b>Win:</b> 4 {icon:plays} Trophies in one successful stream.\n<b>Icons:</b>
      {icon:subs} Clout   {icon:cash} Cash   {icon:risk} Deplatform Risk   {icon:plays}
      Trophies (hover any icon to see what it is).\n<b>Add Viewer:</b> the next viewer
      in the queue joins chat.  <b>End the Stream:</b> banks everyone's {icon:subs}
      and {icon:cash}.\n<b>3 net {icon:risk}</b> = deplatformed (no payout, one viewer
      gets a Temporary Ban).\n<b>Over your Sub Cap</b> = Server Down (no payout).\n<b>Communities:</b>
      each different viewer in chat scores a point for their community; points give
      growing bonuses (Community Beats, top of the chat).\n<b>Shop:</b> {icon:subs}
      recruit viewers (the stock is shared by every player), {icon:cash} raises your
      Sub Cap and pays for streamer actives.\n<b>Keys:</b> Space add viewer/confirm/next
      night, E end the stream, R Audience, Esc menu, F11 fullscreen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
