  - m_Id: 675190142091264
    m_Localized: Core Fanbase
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 675190142091265
    m_Localized: The regulars. Each point gives every Core Fanbase viewer a {per}%
      chance to score twice when the stream ends ({top}% at {max} points).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 675190142091266
    m_Localized: 'Now: {value}% chance per Core Fanbase viewer to score twice.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 675190142091267
    m_Localized: Staff
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 675190142091268
    m_Localized: The people the stream pays. Each point gives every Staff viewer
      a {per}% chance to waive their {icon:cash} cost each time they're scored ({top}%
      at {max} points).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 675190142091269
    m_Localized: 'Now: {value}% chance per Staff scoring to be free.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 675190142091270
    m_Localized: Content
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 675190142091271
