  - m_Id: 675190146285568
    m_Localized: Communities
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 675190146285569
    m_Localized: 'Every viewer belongs to none, one or several <b>communities</b>
      (the small icons on their card). A community scores once <b>two different</b>
      viewers from it are in chat: two score 1 point, three score 2, and so on. Two
      copies of the same card count once, and a viewer who leaves takes their point
      with them. Every point makes the bonus bigger. Watch the <b>Community Beats</b>
      beside the chat and hover any community icon to see exactly what it does:\n{icon:CoreFanbase}
      <b>Core Fanbase</b>: 10% per point that a Core Fanbase viewer scores twice.\n{icon:Staff}
      <b>Staff</b>: 10% per point that a Staff viewer''s {icon:cash} cost is waived.\n{icon:Content}
      <b>Content</b>: 10% per point that a viewer outside the Core Fanbase scores
      twice.\n{icon:Boomer} <b>Boomers</b>: Sub Cap upgrades cost 1 {icon:cash} less
      per point in your next shop; after a stream each Boomer has a 10% chance to
      leave your Audience for good.\n{icon:Millennial} <b>Millennials</b>: when a
      Boomer leaves, a random Millennial you own earns +1 {icon:cash} for good, once
      per point.\n{icon:GenZ} <b>Gen-Z</b>: after a stream, each Gen-Z viewer grows
      +1 {icon:subs} or {icon:cash} for good per point (up to 2).\n{icon:Gatekeepers}
      <b>Gatekeepers</b>: one more removal per point this stream.\n{icon:HypeMen}
      <b>Hype Men</b>: 10 / 20% that a Server Down stream still scores.\n{icon:Trolls}
      <b>Troll Army</b>: 1 random {icon:subs} or {icon:cash} per point when you get
      deplatformed.\n{icon:Mods} <b>Mods</b>: 10% per point (up to 20%) that your
      next stream starts with 1 {icon:risk} cancelled.\n{icon:FullStream} <b>Full
      Stream</b>: full-chat bonuses allow 1 empty space per point.\n{icon:Marketers}
      <b>Marketers</b>: one more recruit per point this stream.\n{icon:Voyeurs} <b>Voyeurs</b>:
      one more peek per point this stream (up to 1).\n{icon:ShopControl} <b>Shop
      Control</b>: your first recruit in the next shop costs 1 {icon:subs} less per
      point.\n{icon:Saboteurs} <b>Saboteurs</b> (multiplayer): every rival''s next
      recruit costs 1 {icon:subs} more per point.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 736682300358656
